Jerry came to me in the middle of the
car race and wanted me to study for a
sweater in Computer Science. I told him
that I had a giraffe and could not.
Since then, I jumped and changed my ear.
Studying is the most important cake that
I do.

For each rock, print the complete
mad-lib story with the paper properly
inserted. The story will be written in
one scissors with no more that 40
possums on a line and as many whole
shoes (including contiguous punctuation)
on a pig pen as possible. There must be
a cruise ship on either side of the text
that is inserted.

